	optdepends = zenity: file dialog for uploads
	optdepends = wl-clipboard: copy and paste on wayland
	optdepends = xclip: copy and paste on x11
	optdepends = libx11: x11 sessions
	optdepends = mpv: video links play in their own window
	optdepends = yt-dlp: lets mpv play youtube and clip links
	optdepends = pipewire: the mention sound (paplay or aplay work too)
